# Internal documents and generated exports - never commit (see 2026-11-11 history scrub)
#
# Internal review, evidence and handoff documents go to ~/xcelsior-internal-docs,
# outside the repository. The Stripe JSON files are exports of live billing
# configuration; the code that reads or generates them (billing/stripe_catalog.py)
# is ordinary code and stays tracked. The polish_stripe_dashboard.py scripts were
# removed in the scrub and are not to be re-added.
#
# tests/test_internal_documents_are_not_tracked.py holds the same list: it fails
# if a file at any of these paths is tracked, or if a rule here stops ignoring
# one. Keep this block last in the file, so no earlier `!` negation can
# re-include a path (in .gitignore the last matching rule wins).
